TEw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aftebb602az_StRyG8SA-O6_Nm1NSKzRCy55h7EcnnIF2Q&oe=69A59AEC"}, {"file_name": "03.png", "id": "1423632349004757", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391950_1423632352338090_4524777843854749483_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z1dnrtWa-2UQ7kNvwHTEEGo&_nc_oc=Adl1UN7z540kTpA_mQi5yhZP2Uq5GNv_OM7lU4gq-ip89TIsNnuEAr21yGIhHhDHB-g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsIzCh2iDFDKQgMqph2n1hDT6Fu5iI0HJSI0La2pLtlxQ&oe=69A58714"}, {"file_name": "02.png", "id": "1161324799063900", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391860_1161324802397233_129808103212474493_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eXqcXW11YO8Q7kNvwF1VIAI&_nc_oc=AdktzaOfZsHvgHY8xPXXY6NTBr0Nrg4nbsKbrGVJ--Q_KqIYdyiTTWD5DD2nhZRPVtg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsRzzSjNMkd5sEIywKmelUtjVdV5mzU67VHfp52npo0XA&oe=69A57265"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "1548219542522619", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392104_1548219545855952_3726187648419365918_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_VFNDjKwxDYQ7kNvwH1TMDW&_nc_oc=Adlz_mGkw--PmGVu7-yOghDhbChNZvZlSQ4rX1avdCuQXjTsngXocq8r1mjJ00035Og&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvRNJ7UrpN15Am5U2nOjvqzxE5GJJFT8lrC8OeJqMCf8A&oe=69A59458"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Where on Earth", "keywords": ["Earth", "World", "Guess", "Travel", "Geo"], "long_description": "From the creators of Wooorld comes Where On Earth\u2014a thrilling, fully social VR location-guessing game where your detective skills and knowledge of the world is put to the test!\n\nStep into immersive real-world locations, search for clues, and pinpoint your location on the map. Play solo, cooperatively with friends, or head-to-head in intense team battles. Explore in 360\u00b0, using intuitive tools like the magnifier, compass and laser pointer to share insights and strategize in real time.\n\n**How it works**:\n\n**\ud83d\udd0e Explore & Investigate** \u2013 Jump to different 360\u00b0 spots, zoom in on details, and analyze your surroundings for clues.\n\n**\ud83d\udccd Make Your Guess** \u2013 Drop a pin on the map and lock in your answer. The closer you are, the higher you score!\n\n**\ud83d\udc65 Team Up or Compete** \u2013 Work together in Co-op Mode or challenge opponents in VS Mode, where teams battle to outguess each other.\n\n**\ud83c\udf0d Social at its core** \u2013 Experience real multiplayer presence with 3D avatars, shared laser pointers, and fun mechanics like seamless teleportation.\n\nWhether you're a geography pro or just love the thrill of discovery, Where On Earth offers an exciting way to test your skills and explore the world\u2014without leaving home.\n\n**Think fast, guess smarter, and prove you know the world!**", "short_description": "From the creators of Wooorld, Where On Earth is the ultimate social VR location-guessing game! Drop into real-world locations, search for clues, and guess where you are. Play together in Co-op or battle it out in VS Mode. Explore in 360\u00b0, use laser pointers to highlight clues, and work together -or against each other- to win. Think you know the world? Prove it!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://wooorld.io/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Wooorld Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://wooorld.io/", "website_url": "https://wooorld.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommen